OL,3,GNEWSAIntruders sprayed guard with
OL,4,Aextinguisher, court hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FPalestine Action activists attacked a
OL,7,Fguard and sprayed him with a fire
OL,8,Fextinguisher during a break-in at a
OL,9,Ffactory associated with an
OL,10,FIsrael-linked defence firm, a court has
OL,11,Fheard.
OL,13,FSecurity guard Billy Dennis told jurors
OL,14,Fintruders smashed the windows of a Land
OL,15,FRover and that he was "struck in the
OL,16,Fface" during the early morning raid on
OL,17,FInstro Precision in Sandwich, Kent, on
OL,18,F17 June, 2024.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
