OL,3,GNEWSAIntruders sprayed guard with
OL,4,Aextinguisher, court hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FNine men and women are on trial at the
OL,7,FOld Bailey accused of criminal damage,
OL,8,Fburglary with intent and violent
OL,9,Fdisorder. They deny the charges.
OL,11,FThe defendants were said to be members
OL,12,For supporters of Palestine Action,
OL,13,Fwhich had targeted Instro Precision for
OL,14,Fits links to Elbit Systems.
